"The Summonarium is LeafSong University's windowless summoning and teleport building."
"It is about half the size of a high school gym, marked with multicolored runic sigils."
"It has a giant medieval-looking wooden door and a scanning foyer."
"Summoned Avowed arrive there, and the House of Healing teleports patients back to it."
"It is always empty when Joe and Alden use it for trips to Moon Thegund."
